# PS4 Linux internal runbook

Before changing **eboot layout**, **create-fself** flags, **PkgLayoutGuard**, or debugging **CE-41839-5** / **CE-34878-0**:

1. Read **`tmp/docs/PS4-LINUX-INTERNAL-RUNBOOK.md`** (canonical how-it-should-work).
2. Pull console evidence via **`swift tools/ps4-linux-console-cycle.swift status`** and **`logs`** (especially **`/data/pkg/ps4-linux-app.log`**).
3. Do **not** reintroduce split **`guest.oelf`** / tiny eboot unless the runbook is explicitly updated with hardware proof.

Public user docs: **`docs/PS4-LINUX-LOADER-PKG.md`**, **`docs/PS4-HOMEBREW-LOADER-PATTERNS.md`**.
